      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRIMINAL MINDS (6) was game in defeat when finished in the minors last start over the 390m at Ballarat, running a good 22.10 in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks hard to top. MR. FLOOD (8) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors five starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (22.27) at this track over 390m. Deserves a win and gets his chance. PAW EDEN (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (24.48) in a Grade 5 at Bendigo. Form here sound including two wins. Worth following up. CHALLENGER (2) picked up an unexpected cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
